{"template-id":"cups-web-lpe-version","template-path":"/Users/kun/DEV/RBKD-templates/http/vulnerabilities/cups-web-lpe-version.yaml","template-encoded":"","info":{"name":"CUPS Local Print Admin Token Disclosure LPE - Version Candidate (CVE-2026-34990)","author":["anchorscan"],"tags":["anchorscan","cve","cve2026","cups","lpe","printer","version"],"description":"CUPS（OpenPrinting）\"Local print admin token disclosure using temporary printers\"：已获本地低权限代码执行的攻击者（前提：可访问 localhost:631 + 可绑非特权本地端口）可起假 IPP 服务，利用 cupsd 对 loopback 对端签发 \"local\" 证书的机制骗取 Authorization: Local 管理令牌，竞态持久化 file:/// device-uri 队列，以 root 落盘 /etc/sudoers.d 提权。影响 CUPS \u003c=2.4.16（含 master 7dc51ee），修复 2.4.17（commit 9fa1c04 / e052dc4，禁 loopback local 证书并弃用明文文件写入后端）。利用为竞态型， 需重试。国内信源 QVD-2026-70361（奇安信 2026-09-18 通告，称 PoC 已公开 已复现；QVD\u003c-\u003eCVE 映射为推测，无权威对照表）。 本模板仅对 631 web 面 GET / 提取版本横幅并对照受影响区间（\u003c2.4.17）—— 端口/版本只是候选证据，不能冒充漏洞确认（Playbook ADR-0001 口径）： 命中仅说明版本落在受影响区间，实际可利用性需攻击者已具备本地执行前提， 且发行版 backport 不改版本号亦可致误报；落地后确证用 postex own/cups-lpe-check.sh（版本区间 + lpstat -v 利用痕迹三态判定）。\n","reference":["https://github.com/OpenPrinting/cups/security/advisories/GHSA-c54j-2vqw-wpwp"],"severity":"medium","metadata":{"max-request":1,"product":"cups","shodan-query":"html:\"Home - CUPS\"","vendor":"openprinting","verified":true},"classification":{"cve-id":["cve-2026-34990"],"cwe-id":null,"cpe":"cpe:2.3:a:openprinting:cups:*:*:*:*:*:*:*:*"},"remediation":"升级 CUPS 至 2.4.17 或更高版本；631 端口（IPP/web 管理）不应暴露给 不可信网络；限制本机非特权用户的本地端口绑定面与 sudoers.d 写入监控。\n"},"extractor-name":"version","type":"http","host":"127.0.0.1","port":"16416","scheme":"http","url":"http://127.0.0.1:16416","matched-at":"http://127.0.0.1:16416/","extracted-results":["2.4.16"],"request":"GET / HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: 127.0.0.1:16416\r\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; WOW64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) ConnectPC Safari/537.36 Browser\r\nAccept: */*\r\nAccept-Language: en\r\nAccept-Encoding: gzip\r\n\r\n","response":"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nContent-Leng